(b) Divide by -15 and reverse sign: x \le 3 \implies {x \text{ real} \mid x \le 3}
(c) -5x + 5 \ge 10 \implies -5x \ge 5 \implies x \le -1 \implies {x \text{ real} \mid x \le -1}
